# LL's own snippet collections. Shipped in the release zip, NEVER in
# git: textpanders holds real email addresses, phone numbers, an
# employee ID and out-of-office text.
#
# 🚨 AND THAT COVERS snippets/bundled.lua TOO (6.105.0), which is the
# whole point of naming it here. The generated table is the SAME data in
# one file — every trigger, every expansion, textpanders included — so
# committing it because "it is only build output" would put the phone
# numbers in git by a side door. It is built at packaging time by
# tools/build-snippets.lua and travels in the zip, like the packs.
snippets/
